320295d2b29355c0ac844db20331, https://si.imgix.net/93e65794/uploads/origins/4b02511d-ca39-433b-aa67-4b000a52a1e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=280ebea253b1e4da3ad9b00785a4ea82 2x, https://si.imgix.net/93e65794/uploads/origins/4b02511d-ca39-433b-aa67-4b000a52a1e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57990051078c86861b73305d0a719a1e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I like your art a lot! Could you please draw my vtuber character:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1TnPCyFC-u4e_NkwqJHxdMkeNkfbB0BAP/view?usp=sharing\nI leave the pose and composition up to you.\nHe is a shape changing monster boy and I would like him to have a cruel sneer, as though he was mocking you. His black tentacles with eyes are an important feature to keep. I would prefer to have a version with a transparent background as well.\nThank you very much for considering my request!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@naminori3220/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/88a5e56e/uploads/origins/d13743bd-744a-4bb5-9d65-705fdf369711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0788daf348c3f49fa422c7b14e50c992", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88a5e56e/uploads/origins/d13743bd-744a-4bb5-9d65-705fdf369711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0788daf348c3f49fa422c7b14e50c992, https://si.imgix.net/88a5e56e/uploads/origins/d13743bd-744a-4bb5-9d65-705fdf369711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e30e0ed5fcf7521bcd44f388542665c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88a5e56e/uploads/origins/d13743bd-744a-4bb5-9d65-705fdf369711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d55f195825025d30eb966f4e08b316c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、なみのり板先生！\n🎄メリークリスマス🎁\n\n武器を持って攻撃する女の子の絵がとても好きです。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@naminori3220/works/11\n\n